* OpenSSH\narchitecture
** Channel layer
*** channels.c, one abstraction
*** ctypes: session, direct-tcpip,\nforwarded-tcpip, x11,\nauth-agent, streamlocal, tun
*** istate / ostate half-close
*** window 2 MiB, packet 32 KiB
*** nchan.c close state machine
** Multiplexing
*** ControlMaster, Unix socket
*** MUX_C_* / MUX_S_* messages
*** passthrough vs proxy mode
*** PROTOCOL.mux
** SFTP transfer
*** 64 outstanding requests
*** 32 KiB buffer
*** window ramps 1 to 64
*** scp defaults to SFTP
** Certificates
*** sshkey_cert, principals,\nvalidity window
*** critical options fail closed
*** extensions fail open
*** auth-options.c enforcement
** Revocation
*** KRL sections
*** list / range / bitmap
*** cost model in bits
** Detached signatures
*** sshsig.c, SSHSIG preamble
*** namespace domain separation
*** ssh-keygen -Y
@endmindmap
